{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34315","headline":"袭美见题郊居十首因次韵酬之以伸荣谢 九 · 陆龟蒙","name":"袭美见题郊居十首因次韵酬之以伸荣谢 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野入青芜巷，陂侵白竹门。\n风高开栗刺，沙浅露芹根。\n迸鼠缘藤桁，饥乌立石盆。\n东吴虽不改，谁是武王孙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34315.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34315","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}